; First Steps in Cantonese / 粵語 (yue)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

搬 box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
加 box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
減 box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
叫系統 box         ; Show the final candy count!
